  "data": {
    "ruleType": "army-rule",
    "summary": "During your Command phase you may choose one of the three Combat Doctrine abilities below; every ADEPTUS ASTARTES unit of yours then has it until your next Command phase starts. Assault Doctrine: the unit may declare a charge even in a turn when it Advanced. Devastator Doctrine: the unit may shoot even in a turn when it Advanced. Tactical Doctrine: the unit may shoot, and may also declare a charge, even in a turn when it Fell Back. You may choose each Combat Doctrine no more than once in the battle.",
